---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Zrosk Investment Management | Partner Profile | Vrosk Energies"
  description="Learn about Zrosk Investment Management—an SEC-licensed alternative asset manager deploying ~$150M across venture capital, private credit, and strategic energy investments."
  currentPath="/zrosk"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 50px; background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.06);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 840px;">
        <div class="badge-pill mint">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          <span>Asset Management Partner</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="heading-1" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Zrosk Investment Management
        </h1>
        <p class="body-lead">
          An SEC-licensed alternative investment management company managing approximately $150M USD in assets, focused on deploying institutional capital across underserved markets and high-impact energy infrastructure.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile Content -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bento-hero-grid">
        <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 44px; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              <span class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; background: rgba(77,255,176,0.18); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full);">
                SEC LICENSED
              </span>
              <img 
                src="/assets/zrosk-logo.png" 
                alt="Zrosk Investment Management" 
                style="height: 32px; width: auto; object-fit: contain;" 
              />
            </div>

            <h2 class="heading-2" style="font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
              $150M+ Across 4 Investment Verticals
            </h2>

            <p class="body-regular" style="margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
              Zrosk Investment Management is a premier alternative investment institution regulated by the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) of Nigeria. The firm specializes in delivering bespoke capital solutions across four dedicated verticals:
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                <div style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--neutral-04);">1. Venture Capital</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">Backing disruptive tech and fintech innovators across Sub-Saharan Africa through Series funding.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                <div style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--neutral-04);">2. Private Credit</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">Providing flexible debt facilities, collateralized inventory lines, and structured trade loans.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                <div style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--neutral-04);">3. Strategic Investments</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">Direct equity co-investments in real-economy assets including midstream energy terminals and manufacturing.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
                <div style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--neutral-04);">4. Proprietary Trading</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">Quantitative execution across fixed income, foreign exchange, and liquid derivative instruments.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="body-regular" style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65;">
              Led by Chairman Shola Adeniyi and Managing Director / Chief Investment Officer Samson Esemuede, CFA (former VP at Citi Bank London and Deutsche Bank London), Zrosk provides Vrosk Energies with deep capital backing for inventory financing, cargo pre-funding, and long-term terminal acquisitions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.08); margin-top: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
            <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--neutral-03);">
              REGULATORY STATUS: SEC NIGERIA LICENSED
            </div>
            <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">
              Contact Syndication Desk →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Bento Cards -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
          <div class="bento-card-dark" style="background: var(--dark-surface-01);">
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: var(--theme-color-01); margin-bottom: 12px;">ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT</div>
            <div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 2.75rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              $150M+
            </div>
            <div class="stat-label" style="color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 12px;">Portfolio Valuation</div>
            <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              Deployed across frontier market credit, venture equities, and strategic commodities.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff;">
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; margin-bottom: 12px;">KEY LEADERSHIP</div>
            <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">Samson Esemuede, CFA</h3>
            <p class="body-small" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Managing Director & Chief Investment Officer, Zrosk & Director of Strategy, Vrosk.</p>
            <a href="/management-team" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--neutral-04);">
              View Executive Profile →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner />
</BaseLayout>
